# Optional: face identity (ArcFace-style embeddings). pnpm eval:setup --identity installs it.
# The default face model is AuraFace v1 (fal/AuraFace-v1, Apache-2.0, trained for commercial use).
# insightface's own buffalo_l pack is non-commercial research only: it is opt-in (--identity-model buffalo_l).
